FR-NB        54.61    2.0158        ! Seminario ferrous, axial His N
FR-NO        65.15    2.0265        ! Seminario ferrous, 4-pyrrole avg (same K as NP)
NP-CC  316.000     1.38400        ! from conste (Henriques 2013)
NO-CC  316.000     1.38400        ! from conste (Henriques 2013)
